OL,3,GNEWSAOwner of missing dog 'taunted' by
OL,4,Ahoax calls
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe owner of a missing dog has said she
OL,7,Ffeels "taunted" by hoax calls and
OL,8,Fapparently AI-generated images claiming
OL,9,Fto show her dog in a poor condition.
OL,11,FKokko, a red cocker spaniel, bolted
OL,12,Fafter being spooked by other dogs while
OL,13,Fout on a walk with a professional dog
OL,14,Fwalker, near Redhill Aerodrome in
OL,15,FSurrey, at about 13:00 BST on 27 July.
OL,17,FNine weeks on, Katie Sharman, Kokko's
OL,18,Fowner, who put up missing dog posters,
OL,19,Fsaid she had been signed off work by
OL,20,Fher GP following the stress and anxiety
OL,21,Fof the events.
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,327,320,200,140,0,100
